{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honogurashi no Niwa is a life simulation game set in a quaint countryside village. While cultivating farmland and raising livestock, you can hunt, fish, and deepen your ties with your fellow villagers. A relaxing, heartwarming pastoral lifestyle awaits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Live out your best rural life in a lush, pristine landscape within Kagatsu Village, a small settlement nestled away in the quiet mountains of Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, in this land overflowing with breathtaking rustic scenery, your life begins anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Living the Laid-Back Farm Life Dream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main character is given an old hut on the outskirts of the village and a rough, weed-filled garden. Your first step is to cultivate this garden and build the farm of your dreams.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934250?t=1757715559","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934250/d450b1aa32e9b3127aca79fd5868d0941cda98ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757715559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934250/e5cc2e19559edbb7a8a771388cd1ad7d93567806/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757715559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934250/e5cc2e19559edbb7a8a771388cd1ad7d93567806/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757715559","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honogurashi no Niwa is a life simulation game set in a quaint countryside village. While cultivating farmland and raising livestock, you can hunt, fish, and deepen your ties with your fellow villagers. A relaxing, heartwarming pastoral lifestyle awaits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Live out your best rural life in a lush, pristine landscape within Kagatsu Village, a small settlement nestled away in the quiet mountains of Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, in this land overflowing with breathtaking rustic scenery, your life begins anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Living the Laid-Back Farm Life Dream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main character is given an old hut on the outskirts of the village and a rough, weed-filled garden. Your first step is to cultivate this garden and build the farm of your dreams.</p>","developers":["Nippon Ichi Software, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934250/29c0811b6bacc4ee013dc48b228cea0de1bc7ca7/header.jpg?t=1757715559","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Honogurashi no Niwa","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBD</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["NIS America, Inc."],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas l\u00edcitas\nAtos criminosos","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Alkoh